  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/09MG">Definition <span data-tag="09MG">12.16.4</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{A}$ be an additive category. If $A = (A^ i)$ is a graded object, then the $k$th <em>shift</em> $A[k]$ is the graded object with $A[k]^ i = A^{k + i}$. </p>
